{"FromContext returns a new TestLogger instance instead of the receiver, causing tests using LoggerMiddleware to fail because log calls happen on an unreferenced instance rather than the injected mock": 0.9326083660125732, "The comment for FromContext is inaccurate - it describes merging with current logger's context but the implementation retrieves the logger directly from context": 0.6666784286499023, "Logger name 'plugin.instrumentation' is inconsistent with the new naming scheme after InstrumentationMiddleware was renamed to MetricsMiddleware - should be renamed to 'plugin.logger' or 'plugin.client'": 0.620527982711792}